Depends: gamelaunch (>= 1.1.2), xlln-bin (>= 1.6.2.1-2), hicolor-icon-theme, umu-launcher | wine | libc6:arm64, libc6:amd64 | umu-launcher, libc6:amd64 | fex-emu | box64, dirt2-wine-steam-data1 (= ${binary:Version}), dirt2-wine-steam-data2 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Colin McRae: DiRT 2 using Wine with data via Steam
 Colin McRae: DiRT 2, run through gamelaunch (umu/Proton or system wine) with
 the game data downloaded from Steam. Games for Windows - LIVE is replaced by
 XLiveLessNess, which restores LAN multiplayer.

